# Per-machine files: written at runtime or generated from your wallpaper.
# If they are still tracked, stop tracking them without deleting your copies:
#   git rm --cached settings.json palette.json bangs.json
# (bangs.json is created from data/bangs.json on first launch; Theme.qml has built-in
#  colours, so a missing palette.json is fine.)
